---
// Página de proposta comercial — noindex,nofollow (nunca indexada pelo Google)
---

<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <meta name="robots" content="noindex,nofollow">
  <title>Demo Recepcionista Virtual con IA · IA Operators</title>
  <style>
    :root {
      --bg: #FFFFFF;
      --bg-alt: #F9FAFB;
      --surface: #FFFFFF;
      --primary: #FF6900;
      --primary-soft: #FFF4ED;
      --primary-border: rgba(255, 105, 0, 0.4);
      --text: #111827;
      --text-muted: #6B7280;
      --text-light: #9CA3AF;
      --border: #E5E7EB;
      --risk: #DC2626;
      --risk-bg: #FEF2F2;
      --positive: #16A34A;
      --positive-bg: #F0FDF4;
      --shadow: 0 1px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);
      --shadow-md: 0 4px 16px rgba(0,0,0,0.10);
      --radius: 12px;
      --radius-sm: 8px;
    }

    *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
    html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }
    body { font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', sans-serif; background: var(--bg); color: var(--text); line-height: 1.6; }

    h1 { font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 4vw, 3rem); font-weight: 800; line-height: 1.15; }
    h2 { font-size: clamp(1.4rem, 2.5vw, 2rem); font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.2; }
    h3 { font-size: 1.15rem; font-weight: 600; }
    h4 { font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 600; }
    p { color: var(--text-muted); }
    strong { color: var(--text); }

    /* NAV */
    .nav {
      position: sticky;
      top: 0;
      z-index: 100;
      background: #fff;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
      padding: 0 2rem;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      height: 56px;
      box-shadow: 0 1px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.06);
    }
    .nav-logo { height: 40px; }
    .nav-links { display: flex; gap: 1.5rem; list-style: none; }
    .nav-links a { text-decoration: none; color: var(--text); font-size: 0.82rem; font-weight: 500; transition: color 0.2s; white-space: nowrap; }
    .nav-links a:hover { color: var(--primary); }

    /* HERO */
    .hero {
      background-image: url('/propostas/Capa-propostas.png');
      background-size: cover;
      background-position: center;
      color: white;
      padding: 4rem 2rem 0;
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
    }
    .hero::before {
      content: '';
      position: absolute;
      inset: 0;
      background: transparent;
      pointer-events: none;
    }
    .hero-inner { max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto; position: relative; z-index: 1; }
    .hero h1 { color: white; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
    .hero-subtitle { font-size: 1.1rem; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.85); margin-bottom: 2.5rem; max-width: 680px; }
    .hero-band {
      background: rgba(0,0,0,0.2);
      margin: 0 -2rem;
      padding: 0.85rem 2rem;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 0.5rem;
      margin-top: 2rem;
    }
    .hero-band span { color: rgba(255,255,255,0.9); font-size: 0.875rem; }
    .badge-proposal {
      background: var(--primary);
      color: white;
      font-size: 0.72rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      padding: 0.3rem 0.9rem;
      border-radius: 999px;
      letter-spacing: 0.06em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    /* SECTIONS */
    .section { padding: 4rem 2rem; }
    .section-alt { background: var(--bg-alt); }
    .container { max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto; }
    .section-label {
      display: inline-block;
      font-size: 0.72rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.12em;
      color: var(--primary);
      margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    }
    .section-title { color: var(--text); margin-bottom: 0.4rem; }
    .section-subtitle { color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 0.97rem; margin-bottom: 2rem; max-width: 680px; }

    /* RESUMEN EJECUTIVO */
    .exec-summary {
      border-left: 4px solid var(--primary);
      background: var(--primary-soft);
      border-radius: 0 var(--radius) var(--radius) 0;
      padding: 2rem 2.5rem;
    }
    .exec-quote {
      font-family: Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif;
      font-size: 1.22rem;
      font-style: italic;
      color: var(--text);
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
      line-height: 1.65;
      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,105,0,0.2);
      padding-bottom: 1.25rem;
    }
    .exec-bullets { list-style: none; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.6rem; }
    .exec-bullets li { display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 0.6rem; color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 0.95rem; }
    .exec-bullets li::before { content: '→'; color: var(--primary); font-weight: 700; flex-shrink: 0; margin-top: 2px; }

    /* STACK CARDS */
    .stack-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(5, 1fr);
      gap: 1rem;
      margin-top: 1.5rem;
    }
    .stack-card {
      background: white;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow);
      border-top: 3px solid var(--primary);
      padding: 1.25rem 1rem;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .stack-name { font-size: 0.95rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text); margin-bottom: 0.4rem; }
    .stack-role { font-size: 0.78rem; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.45; }

    /* MÉTRICAS */
    .metrics-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
      gap: 1rem;
      margin-top: 1.5rem;
    }
    .metric-card {
      background: white;
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-top: 3px solid var(--primary);
      padding: 1.5rem 1rem;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .metric-number {
      font-size: 3.5rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      color: var(--primary);
      line-height: 1;
      margin-bottom: 0.4rem;
    }
    .metric-label { font-size: 0.78rem; color: var(--text-muted); font-weight: 500; line-height: 1.4; }

    /* FLOW */
    .flow-steps {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 0.75rem;
      margin-top: 1.5rem;
    }
    .flow-step {
      display: flex;
      align-items: flex-start;
      gap: 1.25rem;
      background: white;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow);
    }
    .flow-number {
      width: 36px;
      height: 36px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: var(--primary);
      color: white;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      flex-shrink: 0;
    }
    .flow-content h4 { color: var(--text); margin-bottom: 0.2rem; }
    .flow-content p { font-size: 0.88rem; }

    /* TIMELINE */
    .timeline {
      display: flex;
      align-items: flex-start;
      justify-content: space-between;
      position: relative;
      margin-top: 2rem;
    }
    .timeline::before {
      content: '';
      position: absolute;
      top: 28px;
      left: 56px;
      right: 56px;
      height: 2px;
      background: var(--border);
      z-index: 0;
    }
    .timeline-item {
      flex: 1;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
      position: relative;
      z-index: 1;
      padding: 0 0.5rem;
    }
    .timeline-node {
      width: 56px;
      height: 56px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: var(--primary);
      color: white;
      font-size: 1.15rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(255,105,0,0.35);
      flex-shrink: 0;
    }
    .timeline-content {
      background: white;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow);
      padding: 1rem;
      text-align: center;
      width: 100%;
    }
    .timeline-content h4 { color: var(--text); font-size: 0.85rem; margin-bottom: 0.3rem; }
    .timeline-content p { font-size: 0.78rem; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.45; }
    .timeline-deliverable {
      display: inline-block;
      background: var(--primary-soft);
      color: var(--primary);
      font-size: 0.68rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      padding: 0.2rem 0.6rem;
      border-radius: 999px;
      margin-top: 0.6rem;
    }

    /* LEADS CLASSIFICATION */
    .leads-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(5, 1fr);
      gap: 1rem;
      margin-top: 1.5rem;
    }
    .lead-card {
      background: white;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow);
      padding: 1.25rem 1rem;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .lead-icon { font-size: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
    .lead-label { font-size: 0.8rem; font-weight: 600; color: var(--text); line-height: 1.4; }

    /* ENTREGABLES */
    .deliverables-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
      gap: 1.25rem;
      margin-top: 1.5rem;
    }
    .deliverable-card {
      background: white;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow);
      padding: 1.5rem;
      display: flex;
      gap: 1rem;
      align-items: flex-start;
      transition: box-shadow 0.2s, border-color 0.2s;
    }
    .deliverable-card:hover { box-shadow: var(--shadow-md); border-color: var(--primary-border); }
    .deliverable-number {
      font-size: 2.5rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      color: var(--primary);
      line-height: 1;
      flex-shrink: 0;
    }
    .deliverable-content h4 { color: var(--text); margin-bottom: 0.3rem; }
    .deliverable-content p { font-size: 0.85rem; line-height: 1.5; }

    /* INVERSIÓN */
    .investment-card {
      background: var(--primary-soft);
      border: 1px solid var(--primary-border);
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      padding: 2rem;
      margin-top: 1.5rem;
    }
    .investment-table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin: 1rem 0; background: white; border-radius: var(--radius-sm); overflow: hidden; }
    .investment-table th { text-align: left; padding: 0.7rem 1rem; font-size: 0.78rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.06em; color: var(--text-muted); background: var(--bg-alt); border-bottom: 2px solid var(--border); }
    .investment-table td { padding: 0.7rem 1rem; font-size: 0.9rem; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); color: var(--text); }
    .investment-table tr:last-child td { border-bottom: none; }
    .investment-table tr:hover td { background: var(--primary-soft); }
    .price-badge {
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 2.75rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      color: var(--primary);
      margin: 1.25rem 0 0.5rem;
      letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    }
    .price-note { text-align: center; font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--text-muted); margin-bottom: 1.25rem; }
    .payment-milestones {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 1rem;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }
    .payment-milestone {
      background: white;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
      padding: 0.85rem 1.5rem;
      text-align: center;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow);
    }
    .payment-milestone .amount { font-weight: 700; color: var(--text); font-size: 1.1rem; }
    .payment-milestone .label { font-size: 0.78rem; color: var(--text-muted); }
    .payment-arrow { font-size: 1.5rem; color: var(--primary); font-weight: 700; }

    /* INCLUYE */
    .include-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 1.5rem; margin-top: 1.5rem; }
    .include-col { border-radius: var(--radius); padding: 1.75rem; }
    .include-col.yes { background: var(--positive-bg); border-left: 4px solid var(--positive); }
    .include-col.no { background: var(--bg-alt); border-left: 4px solid var(--text-light); }
    .include-col h3 { margin-bottom: 1rem; font-size: 1rem; }
    .include-col.yes h3 { color: var(--positive); }
    .include-col.no h3 { color: var(--text-muted); }
    .include-list { list-style: none; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.65rem; }
    .include-list li { display: flex; gap: 0.6rem; font-size: 0.88rem; align-items: flex-start; color: var(--text); }
    .check-yes { color: var(--positive); font-weight: 700; flex-shrink: 0; margin-top: 1px; }
    .check-no { color: var(--text-light); font-weight: 700; flex-shrink: 0; margin-top: 1px; }

    /* PORTFOLIO NOTE */
    .portfolio-note {
      border-left: 4px solid var(--primary);
      background: var(--primary-soft);
      border-radius: 0 var(--radius) var(--radius) 0;
      padding: 2rem 2.5rem;
      margin-top: 1.5rem;
    }
    .portfolio-note h3 { color: var(--text); margin-bottom: 1.25rem; }
    .portfolio-cards { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 1.25rem; }
    .portfolio-card {
      background: white;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
      padding: 1.25rem;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow);
    }
    .portfolio-card h4 { color: var(--text); margin-bottom: 0.4rem; font-size: 0.95rem; }
    .portfolio-card p { font-size: 0.85rem; line-height: 1.55; margin-bottom: 0.75rem; }
    .portfolio-link {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.3rem;
      color: var(--primary);
      font-size: 0.82rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      text-decoration: none;
    }
    .portfolio-link:hover { text-decoration: underline; }

    /* PRÓXIMOS PASOS */
    .steps-list { list-style: none; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 1rem; margin-top: 1.5rem; }
    .step-item {
      display: flex;
      align-items: flex-start;
      gap: 1rem;
      background: white;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow);
      transition: border-color 0.2s;
    }
    .step-item:hover { border-color: var(--primary-border); }
    .step-checkbox { font-size: 1.4rem; color: var(--primary); flex-shrink: 0; line-height: 1.4; }
    .step-content h4 { color: var(--text); margin-bottom: 0.25rem; }
    .step-content p { font-size: 0.88rem; }
    .validity-badge {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.5rem;
      background: var(--primary-soft);
      color: var(--primary);
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      padding: 0.55rem 1.5rem;
      border-radius: 999px;
      border: 1px solid var(--primary-border);
      margin-top: 1.75rem;
    }

    /* FOOTER */
    .footer {
      background: #111827;
      color: var(--text-light);
      padding: 3rem 2rem 2rem;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .footer-logo { height: 40px; margin-bottom: 1.25rem; display: inline-block; opacity: 0.9; transition: opacity 0.2s; }
    .footer-logo:hover { opacity: 1; }
    .footer-links { display: flex; gap: 1.75rem; justify-content: center; margin: 0.75rem 0 1.25rem; flex-wrap: wrap; }
    .footer-links a { color: var(--text-light); text-decoration: none; font-size: 0.875rem; transition: color 0.2s; }
    .footer-links a:hover { color: var(--primary); }
    .footer-line { width: 40px; height: 2px; background: var(--primary); margin: 0 auto 1rem; border-radius: 2px; }
    .footer-disclaimer { font-size: 0.78rem; color: #4B5563; }

    /* FADE IN */
    .fade-in { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(18px); transition: opacity 0.55s ease, transform 0.55s ease; }
    .fade-in.visible { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }

    /* RESPONSIVE */
    @media (max-width: 960px) {
      .metrics-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
      .stack-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); }
      .leads-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); }
      .deliverables-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
      .portfolio-cards { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    }
    @media (max-width: 680px) {
      .nav-links { display: none; }
      .metrics-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
      .stack-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
      .leads-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
      .deliverables-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .include-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .timeline { flex-direction: column; align-items: stretch; gap: 1.25rem; }
      .timeline::before { display: none; }
      .timeline-item { flex-direction: row; align-items: flex-start; gap: 1rem; padding: 0; }
      .timeline-content { text-align: left; flex: 1; }
      .timeline-node { margin-bottom: 0; }
      .hero-band { flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; }
      .payment-milestones { flex-direction: column; align-items: stretch; }
      .payment-arrow { transform: rotate(90deg); text-align: center; }
    }

    /* PRINT */
    @media print {
      .nav { position: static; box-shadow: none; }
      .hero { -webkit-print-color-adjust: exact; print-color-adjust: exact; }
      .footer { background: #f3f4f6 !important; }
      .footer * { color: #374151 !important; }
      .footer-logo { opacity: 1 !important; }
      .fade-in { opacity: 1 !important; transform: none !important; }
      .section { padding: 2rem 1.5rem; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

<!-- STICKY NAV -->
<nav class="nav">
  <img src="/propostas/Logo-IAOperators.png" alt="IA Operators" class="nav-logo">
  <ul class="nav-links">
    <li><a href="#resumen">Resumen</a></li>
    <li><a href="#arquitectura">Arquitectura</a></li>
    <li><a href="#flujo">Flujo</a></li>
    <li><a href="#roadmap">Roadmap</a></li>
    <li><a href="#entregables">Entregables</a></li>
    <li><a href="#inversion">Inversión</a></li>
    <li><a href="#pasos">Próximos pasos</a></li>
  </ul>
</nav>

<!-- HERO -->
<section class="hero">
  <div class="hero-inner">
    <h1>Demo de Recepcionista<br>Virtual con IA</h1>
    <p class="hero-subtitle">Prototipo funcional y replicable para un centro de estética — flujo completo desde FAQs hasta citas en Google Calendar</p>
  </div>
  <div class="hero-band">
    <span>IA Operators · Luiz Brazão · Mayo 2026</span>
    <span class="badge-proposal">Propuesta Comercial</span>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- RESUMEN EJECUTIVO -->
<section class="section" id="resumen">
  <div class="container">
    <span class="section-label">Resumen ejecutivo</span>
    <h2 class="section-title">Qué es, y qué no es, este proyecto</h2>
    <p class="section-subtitle">Un prototipo bien documentado que puedas mostrar a futuros clientes y replicar — no un sistema de producción completo.</p>
    <div class="exec-summary fade-in">
      <p class="exec-quote">"No es un bot de FAQ. Es un agente que escucha, consulta disponibilidad real, crea la cita y clasifica el lead — todo en la misma conversación."</p>
      <ul class="exec-bullets">
        <li>Flujo completo: responder FAQs, captar datos, consultar disponibilidad, crear citas en Google Calendar y guardar leads clasificados en Google Sheets</li>
        <li>Diseño LLM-first con tools determinísticas: la IA gestiona intención y conversación; las acciones críticas se ejecutan como funciones externas desde Make.com</li>
        <li>Preparado para migrar a WhatsApp Business API en una fase posterior — entrega incluye guía de evolución</li>
        <li>Todas las cuentas quedan en propiedad del cliente; ningún componente alojado en cuentas del freelancer</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ARQUITECTURA / STACK -->
<section class="section section-alt" id="arquitectura">
  <div class="container">
    <span class="section-label">Arquitectura propuesta</span>
    <h2 class="section-title">Stack tecnológico · 4 piezas</h2>
    <p class="section-subtitle">Cada componente tiene una responsabilidad única y bien delimitada. No hay dependencias de cuentas del proveedor.</p>
    <div class="stack-grid fade-in">
      <div class="stack-card">
        <div class="stack-name">Make.com</div>
        <div class="stack-role">Orquestador principal del flujo y ejecución de acciones</div>
      </div>
      <div class="stack-card">
        <div class="stack-name">OpenAI GPT-4o</div>
        <div class="stack-role">Motor conversacional con function calling</div>
      </div>
      <div class="stack-card">
        <div class="stack-name">Google Calendar</div>
        <div class="stack-role">Consulta de disponibilidad y creación de citas</div>
      </div>
      <div class="stack-card">
        <div class="stack-name">Google Sheets</div>
        <div class="stack-role">Base de leads con clasificación de estado</div>
      </div>
      <div class="stack-card">
        <div class="stack-name">Webchat</div>
        <div class="stack-role">Widget conversacional — interfaz de la demo</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div style="margin-top: 2.5rem;">
      <span class="section-label">Diseño de la IA</span>
      <h2 class="section-title">LLM-first con tools determinísticas</h2>
      <p class="section-subtitle">La IA gestiona intención y conversación. Las acciones críticas — consultar disponibilidad, crear cita, guardar lead — se ejecutan como funciones externas. Esto garantiza fiabilidad sin alucinaciones en los datos clave.</p>
    </div>

    <div style="margin-top: 2rem;">
      <span class="section-label">Clasificación de leads</span>
      <h2 class="section-title" style="margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">5 estados en Google Sheets</h2>
      <div class="leads-grid fade-in">
        <div class="lead-card">
          <div class="lead-icon">✅</div>
